      },
      {
        "target": "Take me to town.",
        "base": "Ntwala mu kibuga."
      }
    ],
    "tips": [
      {
        "id": "going-to",
        "title": "“Going to”",
        "body": [
          "Mu Luganda ogamba **Ŋŋenda ku ssomero**. Mu Lungereza ogamba **I am going to school**: **to** kiraga gy’ogenda.",
          "Naye ku waka, toteekako **to**: **I am going home.**"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "culture": [
      {
        "title": "Bodaboda",
        "body": [
          "Ekigambo **boda boda** kiva ku Lungereza “border to border”, kubanga ppikipiki zaasooka okutwala abantu okusala ensalo. Kati kye kigambo kya Uganda n’Olungereza lwaayo."
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "stories": [
    {
      "id": "boda-ride",
      "title": "Okulinya bodaboda",
      "unlockAfter": "u6s3l2",
      "cast": ["emma", "ssali"],
      "summary": "Emma alinya bodaboda okugenda mu kibuga.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "ssali",
            "target": "Where are you going, madam?",
            "base": "Ogenda wa, nnyabo?"
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "emma",
            "target": "Take me to town. How much?",
            "base": "Ntwala mu kibuga. Ssente mmeka?"
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "ssali",
            "target": "Five thousand.",
            "base": "Nkumi ttaano."
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "emma",
            "target": "That’s very expensive! Lower it a bit.",
            "base": "Kya bbeeyi nnyo! Kendeezaako."
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "ssali",
            "target": "Okay, three thousand.",
            "base": "Kale, nkumi ssatu."
          }
        },
        {
          "question": "Basalawo ssente mmeka?",
          "options": ["Nkumi ttaano", "Nkumi ssatu", "Lukumi"],
          "answer": 1
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "ssali",
            "target": "Show me the way.",
            "base": "Ndaga ekkubo."
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "emma",
            "target": "Go straight, turn right.",
            "base": "Genda butereevu, kyuka ku ddyo."
          }
        },
        {
          "question": "Emma agamba bakyuke ludda wa?",
          "options": ["Ku kkono", "Ku ddyo"],
          "answer": 1
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "emma",
            "target": "Stop here. Thank you very much, sir!",
            "base": "Yimirira wano. Weebale nnyo, ssebo!"
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "ssali",
            "target": "Okay, madam. Goodbye!",
            "base": "Kale, nnyabo. Weraba!"
          }
        },
        {
          "question": "Emma agamba atya Ssali ayimirire?",
          "options": ["Go straight", "Stop here", "Turn left"],
          "answer": 1,
          "optionsLang": "target"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
